# [>] generic
# [<] generic
!profiles/**/.*

#[why] AI prose payloads: authored in prose, rendered onto the host by the profiles, never tracked here
/profiles/base/root/_home/.config/ai-agents/docs/*.md
/profiles/claude/root/_home/.config/claude/output-styles/*.md
/profiles/claude/root/_home/.config/claude/rules/**/*.md
#[why] skills render as directories, so the SKILL.md and any sibling payload are ignored while the
#   hand-written scripts/ helpers beside them stay tracked
/profiles/claude/root/_home/.config/claude/skills/**/SKILL.md
/shared/
/.che/cheVariables.local.yml
